comment:
@@chad1411 everything I read indicates the 2024 Olympic track pinarellos are offshoots from the hour record bike, with carbon for women, 3D printed magnesium for men in eg the team pursuit and maybe carbon for men in individual numbers / omnium, sporting the sawtooth feature on several tubes. They also have new bar / stem combos. Pinarello said they don’t see aero benefits in the Hope design with widened forks after extensive research. So yes the bikes seem to be conventional in design, but they aren’t price-wise, and are based on R&D costs that are in the same ballpark as the competition.
So in response to your pedantic latest response: 
1. I was talking about the  women madison as well;

2. The Bolide HR C  is constructed from carbon fibre, though shares the same design as the Bolide F HR 3D;

3. I'm not sure why you mention the standard of 'people to come on the internet to make misinformed comments' or maybe you're talking about yourself?

4. Your mental age / lol reaction indicates something below 18.

